<title>CANADA: TABLE-Hawker Siddeley 6 mnths turns to loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Hawker Siddeley 6 mnths turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			    1996</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	C$0.58   profit	C$0.92</p>
<p> Net	   loss	 4,700   profit	 7,900</p>
<p> Revs			   nil		    1,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Hawker Siddeley Canada Inc. As at June 30 HSC's C$9.1 million equity interest in BeaconEye Inc reflects the company's 31.2 percent interest on the equity basis. The six months 1997 loss comprised HSC's C$4.5 million attributable portion of BeaconEye Inc's consolidated net loss of C$11.1 million for the period, a C$0.8 million gain on dilution of HSC's shareholding in BeaconEye, a loss of C$1.3 milion comprising HSC's corporate costs net of interest income and a C$0.3 million profit from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
